#: src/Admin/Settings.php:129
msgid "Choose UTC or a named IANA region/city timezone, such as UTC, America/New_York, or Asia/Jakarta."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:134
msgid "OpenNow evaluates weekly hours in the business timezone, not the visitor, browser, server, or WordPress site timezone. Raw UTC offsets such as UTC+1 are not supported."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:142
#: src/Admin/Settings.php:256
msgid "CTA appearance"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:144
msgid "Use the native color picker to choose optional six-digit hexadecimal colors such as #166534 or #FFFFFF."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:149
msgid "When a legacy stored value is blank, its picker shows the plugin default (#166534 for the background or #FFFFFF for the text). Legacy blanks remain valid and use that default at runtime; saving the displayed picker value stores an explicit color. These global CTA colors are shared by the shortcode and every OpenNow block. The effective background and text colors must meet WCAG 2.2 AA contrast for normal text."
msgstr ""

